  <div style="max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
    <h3 style="font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-dark);margin-bottom:1rem;">Verified Equipment / 铭牌验证</h3>
    <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--text-body);margin-bottom:1.2rem;line-height:1.6;">This page features a representative Taikan T-V1270S unit from our family workshop. The machine nameplate confirms the model and build record, ensuring full traceability for your project.</p>
